<name>YOSHIMURA, MASASHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A nonlinear optical crystal which is represented by the formula: K2Al2B2O7, a method for wavelength conversion using the optical crystal, and an element and a wavelength conversion apparatus for use in practicing the method. This nonlinear optical crystal is the one for generating vacuum ultraviolet rays which can be grown with ease and is advantageous in practical use.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un cristal optique non linéaire, représenté par la formule K2Al2B2O7, un procédé de conversion de longueur d'onde au moyen de ce cristal, ainsi qu'un élément et un dispositif de conversion de longueur d'onde, utiles dans la mise en pratique du procédé de l'invention. Ce cristal optique non linéaire constitue le cristal qui produit des rayons ultraviolets extrêmes, que l'on peut faire croître facilement et qui est d'utilisation pratique avantageuse.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>